====Reverting to OEM firmware====
->  [[docs:guide-user:installation:generic.flashing.tftp]]

  * Download OEM .dlf firmware file to /tmp on your PC (for instance from [[http://www.engenius-europe.com/index.php/product-zoo/home-soho/item/epg5000#downloads]])
  * Decode .dlf via mkseanofw found in staging_dir/host/bin of OpenWRT buildroot\\ <code>
./mksenaofw -d /tmp/<oem-firmware.dlf> -r 0x101 -p 0x71 -t 2 -o /srv/tftp/oem.img
</code>
  * Boot Serial Console and Press Key 2
  * Use TFTP server with Image oem.img


